Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Owner ke liye ek special tool hai — Financial Pitch Deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeh aapke business ki 3-year projection banata hai, aapke actual Tally data se.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Investors ke saath meeting ho ya bank loan ke liye documentation chaahiye
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,yeh deck ready hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,16 pages, revenue growth chart, gross margin trend, cash flow projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ek teaser version bhi hai — 10 pages — WhatsApp par forward karne ke liye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aur Excel projections file bhi, jismein har month ki numbers editable hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabhi files apne aap generate hoti hain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Owner Console mein Generate Pitch Deck button dabaayein.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do minute mein PDF aur Excel dono ready.
